\section*{3. Critical Mitigation Principles}
\begin{itemize}
    \item Enforce hard safety states when $A(t)$ or telemetry is invalid.
    \item Prefer load preservation for CRT/IND over optimal routing.
    \item Treat any ACE anomaly as a bus-compromise event.
    \item Log all $\Omega$ transitions with cause and latency.
\end{itemize}

